### 注册新用户
POST http://localhost:2333/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser1",
  "password": "123456",
  "env": {
    "ipv4": "192.168.1.1",
    "ipv6": "",
    "os": "Windows 11",
    "device_info": "Chrome 120"
  }
}

