### 登录
POST http://localhost:2333/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser1",
  "password": "123456",
  "env": {
    "ipv4": "192.168.1.1",
    "ipv6": "",
    "os": "Windows 11",
    "device_info": "Chrome 120"
  }
}

### 获取当前用户信息
GET http://localhost:2333/api/me
Cookie: access-token={{login.response.body.data.token.access_token}}; refresh-token={{login.response.body.data.token.refresh_token}}

### 创建帖子
POST http://localhost:2333/api/create
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access-token={{login.response.body.data.token.access_token}}; refresh-token={{login.response.body.data.token.refresh_token}}

{
  "title": "测试帖子",
  "content": "这是一个测试帖子的内容",
  "category": "test",
  "tags": ["test", "demo"]
}

### 获取帖子列表
GET http://localhost:2333/api/post?page=1&page_size=10
Cookie: access-token={{login.response.body.data.token.access_token}}; refresh-token={{login.response.body.data.token.refresh_token}}

### 搜索帖子
GET http://localhost:2333/api/post/search?keyword=test&page=1&page_size=10
Cookie: access-token={{login.response.body.data.token.access_token}}; refresh-token={{login.response.body.data.token.refresh_token}}

### 获取行情数据
GET http://localhost:2333/api/market

### 获取历史行情
GET http://localhost:2333/api/market/history?from=1717000000000&to=1717100000000
